    "turn_text": "Joining us now from the campaign trail is our NBC News team. Garrett Hake is following the Trump campaign in Georgia. Mike Memley covering the Harris campaign in Michigan and Shaquille Brewster is in Detroit. Garrett, let's start with you. Trump in battleground Georgia today after making his closing argument in Blue New York. Why the decision to come to Georgia today?",
