    "turn_text": "And we talked quite a bit about the fallout from this weekend's rally at Madison Square Garden. And I do think it's pretty notable that the campaign is making a very specific effort to clean up those comments about Puerto Rico. I mean, there was plenty of inflammatory stuff that happened during that rally last night, but they seem particularly fixated about this. Why do you think that is?",
