    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80807.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 14,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, I think, Garrett, we often talk about Donald Trump in the macro sense, right? It's just another thing to add to the pile. And maybe that doesn't move massive amounts of voters. But we're at the stage now where we do have to focus on the micro, right? And, you know, a few thousand voters, ten thousand voters in certain swing areas could really be the difference between winning and losing the entire presidential race.",
