    "turn_idx": 15,
    "turn_text": "I think that's exactly right, and there's also this element, Ryan, where sometimes it's a little bit easier to laugh off or disregard Donald Trump's comments, and I hear this from Trump supporters, when they're about somebody else. But eventually, the comments come around to be about you. Now, of course, these were not comments from Donald Trump, but we've also not heard him come out and say that he disavows them, or that he thinks they were inappropriate, or that he disagrees with them. echo comments he has made about our country about latin america about other countries uh... who have diaspora their populations have a diaspora in this country is part of this country but you take my point All of this could matter again at that micro level and in a race where everybody who's paying close attention to it thinks it will be decided very, very narrowly.",
