  {
    "episode_id": 80807,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80807.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 18,
    "turn_text": "All right, Garrett, Hank, the finish slide is in sight, my friend. Just keep burning right until the end of it. We'll check back with you, I'm sure, multiple times before election day. Let's turn down to Mike Memley, who's covering the Harris campaign for us today. Mike, we did hear the Vice President calling Trump divisive, again, differentiating herself. What should we expect from this big Harris speech that's going to take place on the ellipse on Tuesday?",
