        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Mike Memley is a credible source of information about the Harris campaign.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Continued effort by Garrett and Hank is expected to lead to meaningful outcomes.",
