        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Harris will deliver the speech with the White House visible behind her.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The visual presence of the White House behind Harris is intended to create a contrast with former President Trump’s leadership style.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The Biden administration believes President Biden has worked to unify the country and accomplish legislative goals.",
