    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80807.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 63,
    "turn_text": "Can someone tell me why we are once again holding Kamala to a higher standard than her opponent? I hope you'll forgive me if I'm a little frustrated that some of us are choosing to ignore Donald Trump's gross incompetence while asking Kamala to dazzle us at every turn. If we don't get this election right, your wife, your daughter, your mother, we as women will become collateral damage to your rage.",
