        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Trump’s actions constitute genuine incompetence rather than mere policy disagreement.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes their perspective represents a legitimate moral concern shared by other women.",
